  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $3 x^2-2 x(a+b+c)+a b+b c+c a=0$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{D}=4(a+b+c)^2-4.3(a b+b c+c a) \\\\\n& =4\\left(a^2+b^2+c^2-a b-b c-c a\\right) \\\\\n& =2\\left[(a-b)^2+(b-c)^2+(c-a)^2\\right] \\\\\n& =\\left[(a-b)^2+(b-c)^2+(c-a)^2\\right] \\\\\n& \\geq 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
